OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AImages of asteroid targeted to test
OL,4,AEarth's defences reveal stadium-sized
OL,5,Acrater
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour years on, a European Space Agency
OL,8,F(ESA) spacecraft called Hera is
OL,9,Fscouring the scene to fully assess the
OL,10,Faftermath of the collision.
OL,12,F"The crater is almost as large as the
OL,13,Fbody itself, which is really, really
OL,14,Fspectacular," said Dr Sabina Raducan, a
OL,15,Fplanetary scientist, who is on the Hera
OL,16,Fscience team.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
