OL,3,AIsraeli judges recommend dropping most
OL,4,Aserious charges against Netanyahu
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey also questioned whether his
OL,7,Factions amounted to criminal conduct in
OL,8,Fa second corruption case, and suggested
OL,9,Fprosecutors seek a plea deal in a
OL,10,Fthird.
OL,12,FNetanyahu has consistently denied the
OL,13,Fallegations against him and called on
OL,14,FWednesday for the trial to be ended
OL,15,F"immediately".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
